}

# --- crmath_kx.cyr ---

# crmath_kx.cyr — kimiya's correctly rounded monomials, square roots of quotients and binary64 with an
# unbounded exponent (kimiya ADR 0002 #20, #27–#32), for bijli's range-edge Part (M1 part 5).
#
